OL,3,ASoho House venue under investigation
OL,4,Afor food safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added that the food incident was
OL,7,Fisolated and re-labelling unsold food
OL,8,Fwas not company policy, but it did not
OL,9,Fcomment on the rats claim.
